      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonore%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1889 the station was renamed Leonore because another Gary post office already existed.",
